                VENUS E Mini
                <span class="product-new-tag">NEU</span>
                <br>2kWh / 1.5kW
              </h3>
              <p class="product-desc-text">Welt dünnster Plug-in Speicher, nur 10,5cm Tiefe</p>
              <div class="product-btn-group">
                <a href="#" class="btn-primary-shop">Jetzt shoppen</a>
                <a href="#" class="btn-secondary-info">Mehr erfahren</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
    
          <!-- 卡片2：VENUS E 4.0 -->
          <div class="product-card">
            <img class="product-bg-img" src="替换第二张产品图链接" alt="VENUS E 4.0">
            <div class="product-content-wrap">
              <p class="product-top-slogan">3kW Spitzenleistung</p>
              <h3 class="product-model-title">
                VENUS E 4.0
                <span class="product-new-tag">NEU</span>
